# Bruce Banner: "{2}{R}{R}{G}{G}: Transform Bruce Banner. Activate only as a sorcery." In turn 3 Bot1 pays it exactly with
# Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R}, Forest, Mox Emerald and Mox Pearl (the pool is empty) and he becomes The Incredible Hulk, an 8/8 with
# reach and trample. "Enrage - Whenever The Incredible Hulk is dealt damage, put a +1/+1 counter on him. If he's attacking, untap
# him and there is an additional combat phase after this phase." He attacks, Bot2's Grizzly Bears block and deal 2 to him: the
# counter (a 9/9), he untaps and a second combat follows. The Bears took 2 and the trample 6 went to Bot2 (14); in the
# second combat the unblocked 9/9 hits for 9 (5). In Bot2's turn 4 a Lightning Bolt hurts the tapped Hulk: another counter, but he
# is not attacking, so he stays tapped and there is no extra combat.

